OL,3,GNEWSAE-scooter operator can double
OL,4,Afleet in town
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn e-scooter operator running a scheme
OL,7,Fin a Berkshire town has been given
OL,8,Fpermission to double the size of its
OL,9,Ffleet.
OL,11,FVoi has run the government-approved
OL,12,Ftrial scheme in Slough after it took
OL,13,Fover from another provider in December
OL,14,F2024 and was allowed a fleet of 300
OL,15,Fe-scooters.
OL,17,FBut Slough Borough Council's cabinet
OL,18,Fapproved increasing that to a maximum
OL,19,Fof 600 e-scooters at a meeting on
OL,20,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
