OL,3,GNEWSAE-scooter operator can double
OL,4,Afleet in town
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said that will improve
OL,7,Faccessibility around the borough,
OL,8,F"support growing demand" and could be
OL,9,Fincreased to 1,000 vehicles later.
